<https://w3id.org/OntoGSN/ontology#top> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A GSN Goal that presents the pinnacle claim in an argument. It is ‘top’ in terms of the argument hierarchy, rather than necessarily its physical layout. There may be more than one top goal in a GSN structure."@en .
<https://w3id.org/OntoGSN/ontology#top> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The top goal presents the overall claim asserted by the author and it is up to the reader to determine their belief that it is adequately supported."@en .
