<https://w3id.org/OntoGSN/ontology#Argument> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Argument"@en .
<https://w3id.org/OntoGSN/ontology#Argument> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A body of information presented with the intention to establish one or more claims through the presentation of related supporting claims, evidence and contextual information."@en .
<https://w3id.org/OntoGSN/ontology#Argument> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A connected series of claims intended to establish an overall claim."@en .
<https://w3id.org/OntoGSN/ontology#Argument> <https://w3id.org/OntoGSN/ontology#coreOrExtension> "Core GSN"@en .
