_:genid118 <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The corresponding argument could be located in a paragraph of accompanying text, a goal in the local argument, or a goal in a separate module."@en .
_:genid118 <https://w3id.org/OntoGSN/ontology#coreOrExtension> "Confidence Argument Extension" .
