<https://w3id.org/OntoGSN/ontology#Artefact> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "[OntoGSN] Information or objective artefacts (e.g., files) being offered in support or context of one or more claims."@en .
<https://w3id.org/OntoGSN/ontology#Artefact> <https://w3id.org/OntoGSN/ontology#coreOrExtension> "Core GSN"@en .
