<https://w3id.org/OntoGSN/ontology#ArtefactReference> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "[OntoGSN] An element that makes no claim of its own and instead points at an artefact, such as a solution or a context expressed as a noun phrase."@en .
<https://w3id.org/OntoGSN/ontology#ArtefactReference> <https://w3id.org/OntoGSN/ontology#coreOrExtension> "Core GSN"@en .
