<https://w3id.org/OntoGSN/ontology#AssuranceCase> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Assurance Case"@en .
<https://w3id.org/OntoGSN/ontology#AssuranceCase> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A reasoned and compelling argument, supported by a body of evidence, that a system, service or organisation will operate as intended for a defined application in a defined environment."@en .
<https://w3id.org/OntoGSN/ontology#AssuranceCase> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Arguments and evidence intended to demonstrate that a system meets its assurance requirements."@en .
<https://w3id.org/OntoGSN/ontology#AssuranceCase> <https://w3id.org/OntoGSN/ontology#coreOrExtension> "Core GSN"@en .
