<https://w3id.org/OntoGSN/ontology#Catalogue> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A pattern catalogue may be created to collate a series of patterns; where such a catalogue is created the structure and format of the definition should be consistent and each pattern’s definition should have a unique {pattern identifier}."@en .
