<https://w3id.org/OntoGSN/ontology#Module> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Goal structures can be partitioned into separate, but interrelated, modules. This can allow the division of an overall goal structure into separate goal structures focusing on particular aspects of the overall argument. A module may contain one or more arguments and may contain other modules."@en .
<https://w3id.org/OntoGSN/ontology#Module> <https://w3id.org/OntoGSN/ontology#coreOrExtension> "Modular Extension"@en .
<https://w3id.org/OntoGSN/ontology#Module> <https://w3id.org/OntoGSN/ontology#renderedAs> "a rectangle with a second smaller rectangle adjoining at the top left" .
